{"words": [{"text": "يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ", "translation": "They ask you"}, {"text": "عَنِ", "translation": "about"}, {"text": "ٱلشَّهْرِ", "translation": "the month"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَرَامِ", "translation": "[the] sacred "}, {"text": "قِتَالٍۢ", "translation": "(concerning) fighting"}, {"text": "فِيهِ ۖ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "قُلْ", "translation": "Say"}, {"text": "قِتَالٌۭ", "translation": "Fighting"}, {"text": "فِيهِ", "translation": "therein"}, {"text": "كَبِيرٌۭ ۖ", "translation": "(is) a great (sin)"}, {"text": "وَصَدٌّ", "translation": "but hindering (people)"}, {"text": "عَن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "سَبِيلِ", "translation": "(the) way"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَكُفْرٌۢ", "translation": "and disbelief"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "translation": "in Him"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمَسْجِدِ", "translation": "and (preventing access to) Al-Masjid"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَرَامِ", "translation": "Al-Haraam"}, {"text": "وَإِخْرَاجُ", "translation": "and driving out"}, {"text": "أَهْلِهِۦ", "translation": "its people"}, {"text": "مِنْهُ", "translation": "from it"}, {"text": "أَكْبَرُ", "translation": "(is) greater (sin)"}, {"text": "عِندَ", "translation": "near"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۚ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَٱلْفِتْنَةُ", "translation": "And [the] oppression"}, {"text": "أَكْبَرُ", "translation": "(is) greater"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "than"}, {"text": "ٱلْقَتْلِ ۗ", "translation": "[the] killing"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "يَزَالُونَ", "translation": "they will cease"}, {"text": "يُقَـٰتِلُونَكُمْ", "translation": "(to) fight with you"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "يَرُدُّوكُمْ", "translation": "they turn you away"}, {"text": "عَن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "دِينِكُمْ", "translation": "your religion"}, {"text": "إِنِ", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "ٱسْتَطَـٰعُوا۟ ۚ", "translation": "they are able"}, {"text": "وَمَن", "translation": "And whoever"}, {"text": "يَرْتَدِدْ", "translation": "turns away"}, {"text": "مِنكُمْ", "translation": "among you"}, {"text": "عَن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "دِينِهِۦ", "translation": "his religion"}, {"text": "فَيَمُتْ", "translation": "then dies"}, {"text": "وَهُوَ", "translation": "while he"}, {"text": "كَافِرٌۭ", "translation": "(is) a disbeliever"}, {"text": "فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "for those"}, {"text": "حَبِطَتْ", "translation": "became worthless"}, {"text": "أَعْمَـٰلُهُمْ", "translation": "their deeds"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "translation": "the world"}, {"text": "وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ", "translation": "and the Hereafter"}, {"text": "وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "And those"}, {"text": "أَصْحَـٰبُ", "translation": "(are) companions"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّارِ ۖ", "translation": "(of) the Fire"}, {"text": "هُمْ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "خَـٰلِدُونَ", "translation": "(will) abide forever"}], "sahih": "They ask you about the sacred month1 - about fighting therein. Say, \"Fighting therein is great [sin], but averting [people] from the way of Allāh and disbelief in Him and [preventing access to] al-Masjid al-Ḥarām and the expulsion of its people therefrom are greater [evil] in the sight of Allāh. And fitnah2 is greater than killing.\" And they will continue to fight you until they turn you back from your religion if they are able. And whoever of you reverts from his religion [to disbelief] and dies while he is a disbeliever - for those, their deeds have become worthless in this world and the Hereafter, and those are the companions of the Fire; they will abide therein eternally."}